{"id":915,"date":"2014-06-06T13:40:01","date_gmt":"2014-06-06T13:40:01","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=915"},"modified":"2015-05-18T20:15:19","modified_gmt":"2015-05-18T20:15:19","slug":"scientific-programme","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/berlin2014\/scientific-programme\/","title":{"rendered":"Scientific Programme"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3>Overview<\/h3>\n<h3>Tutorials<\/h3>\n<p><em><strong>Tuesday, December 9<\/strong><\/em><br \/>\n<em>Location:\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.seminaris.de\/en\/hotels\/seminaris-campushotel-berlin\/accommodation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seminaris Campus Hotel<\/a> (see <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/berlin2014\/useful-info\/\">useful info<\/a>)<\/em><\/p>\n<h4>Tutorials in Parallel Tracks 1 &amp; 2<\/h4>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>9:00<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<ol>\n<li value=\"A\"><strong>[Sorbonne room] <a href=\"#ebirdf\">RDF linked data at the European Bioinformatics Institute<\/a> <\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>[Oxford room] <a href=\"#insight\">Ontologising the Health Level Seven (HL7) Standard<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>10:00<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><strong>Coffee break<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>10:30<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<ol>\n<li value=\"A\"><strong>[Sorbonne room] <a href=\"#ebirdf\">RDF linked data at the European Bioinformatics Institute continues..<\/a> <\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>[Oxford room] <a href=\"#insight\">Ontologising the Health Level Seven (HL7) Standard continues..<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>11:30<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><strong>Lunch<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>13:00<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<ol>\n<li value=\"A\"><strong>[Sorbonne room] <a href=\"#ontop\">Ontologies Ontop Databases<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>[Oxford room] <a href=\"#shapes\">RDF validation and transformation using Shape Expressions<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>15:00<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><strong>Coffee break<\/strong><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>15:30<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<ol>\n<li value=\"A\"><strong>[Sorbonne room] <a href=\"#natlan\">Natural Language Interfaces for SPARQL endpoints<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>[Oxford room] <a href=\"#rules\">Introduction to rule systems<\/a><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"75\"><strong>18:00-21:00<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\"><strong>[Conference Center Ground floor] Pre-workshop poster session with the Berlin Semantic Web Meetup.<\/strong><br \/>\nPresenters of posters and demo are invited to expose their posters already on Tuesday night, where SWAT4LS will be open to the Berlin Semantic Web Meetup group to share experiences in an informal setting.<br \/>\nDrinks and finger-food will be provided.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Workshop<\/h3>\n<p><em><strong>Wednesday, December 10, 2014<\/strong><\/em><br \/>\n<em>Location:\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.seminaris.de\/en\/hotels\/seminaris-campushotel-berlin\/accommodation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Seminaris Campus Hotel<\/a> (see <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/berlin2014\/useful-info\/\">useful info<\/a>)<\/em><br \/>\n<strong>Preliminary Program<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"150\"><strong>08:30-09:00<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">Registration<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"150\"><strong>09:00-09:10<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">Welcome and introduction<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"150\"><strong>09:10-09:55<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">Keynote: <a href=\"#Dekker\"><br \/>\n<strong>Knowledge Engineering in Radiation Oncology \u2013 A real-world application of Semantic Web technology<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nAndre Dekker, MAASTRO Clinic, NL<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"150\"><strong>09:55-09:35<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">session 1 (2 <a href=\"#papers\">full papers<\/a>)<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Angel Esteban-Gil, Jesualdo Tomas Fernandez-Breis and Martin Boeker. <a title=\"Presentation Esteban Gil\" href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/12\/SWAT4LS-2014-Esteban-Gil.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Analysis and visualization of disease courses in a semantic enabled cancer registry<\/strong><\/a> (full paper)<\/li>\n<li>Guoqian Jiang, Deepak Sharma, Harold Solbrig, Cui Tao, Chunhua Weng and Christopher Chute. <a title=\"Presentation Guoqian Jiang\" href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/12\/SWAT4LS-2014-Esteban-Gil.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Building A Semantic Web-based Metadata Repository for Facilitating Detailed Clinical Modeling in Cancer Genome Studies<\/strong><\/a> (full paper)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"150\"><strong>10:35-11:00<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">Coffee break<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"150\"><strong>11:00-12:05<\/strong><\/td>\n<td valign=\"top\">session 2 (2 <a href=\"#papers\">full papers<\/a> + 2 <a href=\"#spapers\">short<\/a>\/<a href=\"#ppapers\">position papers<\/a>)<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vassilis Koutkias and Marie-Christine Jaulent. <a title=\"Presentation Koutkias\" href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/12\/Koutkias_SWAT4LS_2014.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Leveraging Post-marketing Drug Safety Research through Semantic Technologies: The PharmacoVigilance Signal Detectors Ontology<\/strong><\/a> (full paper)<strong><br \/>\n<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Andre Freitas, K